# Bat Hunt (San d'Oria 1-2): Ambrotien in Southern San d'Oria. A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with 1-1 completed,
# holding an Orcish Scale Mail and a Bat Fang. Section 1: Ambrotien's script plays 2009; its finish with option 101
# begins the mission. Section 2 (status 0): Ambrotien plays 2021. Section 3 (status 2, a GM): Ambrotien plays 2022; the
# Orcish Scale Mail traded: 2023, whose finish completes the mission. Begun again and set to status 2: the Bat Fang
# traded: 2003, whose finish completes it again.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2003 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2023
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=93.4,0,-55.5 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
item OrcishMailScales
item BatFang
login
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 1: 2009
finish option=101                       # begun
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 2 (status 0): 2021
finish
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 3: 2022
finish
walk 92.4,0,-55.5
trade Ambrotien OrcishMailScales x1     # 2023
finish                                  # completed
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 1: 2009
finish option=101                       # begun again
missionstatus Sandoria 2
trade Ambrotien BatFang x1              # 2003
finish                                  # completed again
